24bc058066fd57848e788b465719b0e6da2f98f7. Its paths describe the old web
client, which this crate replaces. Here, the keydown decision is ported in
src/keys.rs, the cell size (DomRenderer's _updateDimensions), mouse cell
rounding, move de-duplication and wheel step accumulation in
